{"id":13273,"artist":"The Moody blues.","title":"Nights in white satin","lyrics_plain":"Nights in white satin, never reaching the end,\nLetters I've written, never meaning to send.\nBeauty I'd always missed with these eyes before.\nJust what the truth is, I can't say anymore.\n'Cos I love you, yes I love you, oh how I love you.\nGazing at people, some hand in hand,\nJust what I'm going through they can't understand.\nSome try to tell me, thoughts they cannot defend,\nJust what you want to be, you will be in the end.\nAnd I love you, yes I love you,\nOh how I love you, oh how I love you.\nNights in white satin, never reaching the end,\nLetters I've written, never meaning to send.\nBeauty I've always missed, with these eyes before.\nJust what the truth is, I can't say anymore.\n'Cos I love you, yes I love you,\nOh how I love you, oh I love you,\n'Cos I love you, yes I love you,\nOh how I love you, oh how I love you.\n@FeuNeuLeu.","lyrics_synced":"[00:03.32] Nights in white satin, never reaching the end,\n[00:12.21] Letters I've written, never meaning to send.\n[00:21.10] Beauty I'd always missed with these eyes before.\n[00:29.99] Just what the truth is, I can't say anymore.\n[00:37.02] 'Cos I love you, yes I love you, oh how I love you.\n[00:56.65] Gazing at people, some hand in hand,\n[01:05.54] Just what I'm going through they can't understand.\n[01:14.43] Some try to tell me, thoughts they cannot defend,\n[01:23.32] Just what you want to be, you will be in the end.\n[01:30.36] And I love you, yes I love you,\n[01:37.77] Oh how I love you, oh how I love you.\n[02:47.77] Nights in white satin, never reaching the end,\n[02:56.65] Letters I've written, never meaning to send.\n[03:05.54] Beauty I've always missed, with these eyes before.\n[03:14.43] Just what the truth is, I can't say anymore.\n[03:21.47] 'Cos I love you, yes I love you,\n[03:28.88] Oh how I love you, oh I love you,\n[03:48.14] 'Cos I love you, yes I love you,\n[03:55.54] Oh how I love you, oh how I lo